        <mxCell id="5Z18dDXLKnPu8NKGoF6B-48" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Ingestion Pipeline&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;The user submits a query through the interface.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The React-based user interface facilitates user interaction.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;User authentication is handled via AWS Cognito.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The document is forwarded to the FastAPI backend.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Upload document endpoint is called.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The document is saved in S3&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Event is triggered for the document upload.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Request is forwarded to AWS SQS&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Layout detection is done via AWS Textract&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chunking pipeline is executed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chunk are processed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chunks are converted into embeddings using an AWS Bedrock Titan embedding model.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The chunk metadata enrichment will be done using AWS comprehend.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chunk embedding along with metadata is combined to be saved in opensearch.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Both Dense and Splade will be stored for Hybrid Retrival.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chunks are saved in Opensearch.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;User history logs will be stored in Dynamo DB&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="504" width="230" x="849" y="-140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
